<title>USA: Evans Withycombe sells 1.8 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Evans Withycombe sells 1.8 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evans Withycombe Residential Inc on Tuesday said it has sold 1.8 million shares of its common stock in an offering priced at $21.00 per share via managing underwriter Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>In addition, the company has granted underwriters an option to purchase up to an additional 270,000 shares.</p>
</text>
